# WebRTC latency harness: pinned third-party binaries and per-run measurement
# output. Baselines worth keeping are committed explicitly by filename.
webrtc/vendor/
# Scratch space for measurement output and one-off audit scripts. Useful to keep on disk,
# not useful in the repository.
webrtc/local/
webrtc/results/
# Private keys and self-signed certs MediaMTX writes into whatever its working directory
# happens to be at startup. Unanchored because that directory is not always webrtc/ - these
# have been committed by accident twice, from two different directories, which is exactly
# why this rule matches by name anywhere rather than by path.
auto.crt
auto.key
# Any other key material, so the next accident is caught by the pattern rather than by
# someone noticing it in a diff.
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
